             timestep, critically damped. The parent leap_main solref="0.0001" is 40x
             below that floor -> the friction constraint can't hold a static tangential
             load and the grasped object creeps through the fingers. solimp reverts to
             MuJoCo's default (smooth soft->hard impedance) from the degenerate
             dmin=dmax=0.999. -->
